{"id":"920317161a2cce71","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-truth-at-world.md","title":"Truth at a World","display":"df-truth-at-world — Truth at a World","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-truth-at-world","aliases":["89-df-truth-at-world","truth at world","在世界中真"],"display":"df-truth-at-world — Truth at a World","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-world]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-truth-at-world"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-truth-at-world</span><span>truth at world</span><span>在世界中真</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-at-world — Truth at a World"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\\)</span> (Kripke model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w \\in W\">\\(w \\in W\\)</span> (world, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal M}(w,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal M}(w,A)\\)</span> 是下述定义的局部真值谓词，世界与公式为两个参数，模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 为固定环境。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}at\\text{-}world}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal M}(w,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal{M},w\\models A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}at\\text{-}world}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal M}(w,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal{M},w\\models A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件给 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a> 的满足关系提供真值谓词别名，不重复一套递归语义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> : 满足关系（真值关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&quot;在世界中真&quot;定义了模态公式的局部真值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个公式在特定世界中可能有不同真值</li>\n<li>模态算子通过可及世界扩展真值</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在可证性逻辑中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只有在另行给定可证性解释时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box/\\Diamond\">\\(\\Box/\\Diamond\\)</span> 才可读成“可证/相容”；\n裸 Kripke 模型本身只给出沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的真值条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>局部真值的重要性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原子公式的真值由赋值函数决定</li>\n<li>模态算子的真值依赖于可及关系</li>\n<li>传递框架中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box \\Box \\varphi\">\\(\\Box \\Box \\varphi\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box \\varphi\">\\(\\Box \\varphi\\)</span> 有特殊关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a>：满足关系的完整定义</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a>：在所有世界中真</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"89ed9a6623b0dfc3\" href=\"?note=89ed9a6623b0dfc3\" title=\"89-df-kripke-semantics-gl\">89-df-kripke-semantics-gl</a>：GL逻辑的特殊语义</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：Boolos，第 4 章 pp.68–71 的递归满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-world","status":"resolved","id":"edcd1eb132936613","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-world]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)$ (Kripke model, see [[89-df-kripke-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-world","status":"resolved","id":"edcd1eb132936613","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$w \\in W$ (world, see [[89-df-world]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-modal-formula]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件给 [[89-df-satisfaction-modal]] 的满足关系提供真值谓词别名，不重复一套递归语义。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]：满足关系的完整定义","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]：在所有世界中真","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-semantics-gl","status":"resolved","id":"89ed9a6623b0dfc3","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-semantics-gl]]：GL逻辑的特殊语义","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)","display":false},{"tex":"w \\in W","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal M}(w,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}at\\text{-}world}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathcal M}(w,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal{M},w\\models A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box/\\Diamond","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box \\Box \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box \\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1865,"backlinks":[{"id":"774a7723667e1813","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-truth-at-world]]：真值集的基本元素"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-truth-at-world]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-371","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-truth-at-world]]"}],"outgoing":["ab746eb779e20ce0","edcd1eb132936613","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","9f00301866fbd6f0","dbba58e7bd3b0667","89ed9a6623b0dfc3"]}